        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "前ハ庚午六月十九日調後ハ年月ヲ詳カニセス"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "前は庚午六月十九日調べ、後は年月を詳らかにせず／まえはこうごろくがつじゅうくにちしらべ、のちはねんげつをつまびらかにせず"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Editorial dating rubric heading the block: \"The earlier [returns] were surveyed on the 19th day of the 6th month of the kanoe-uma year (Meiji 3, 1870); for the later [returns] the year and month are not specified.\" It signals that the entries that follow arrived in more than one reporting batch."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "survey notation"
